{"metadata":{"description":"微软跨平台沙盒支持","id":"gh:1323134652","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"sandbox-mxc","slug":"omdsh-dev/sandbox-mxc","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin","sandbox"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"# `@deepseek-ai/dsh-sandbox-mxc`"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A Stent sidecar that runs the DSH bash, PowerShell, and persistent-terminal payloads through MXC wit"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"hout modifying DeepSeek Harness source files. The package is an explicit opt-in bundle: DSH keeps ow"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"nership of `ctx.sandbox`, subprocess I/O, deadlines, signals, terminal sessions, and teardown; Stent"},{"id":"p3s4","text":" supplies the controlled load-time hooks that replace only the consumer call paths."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Package surface"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The package root is the Stent function plugin and deliberately has no default export. The compatibil"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ity provider and policy compiler are also available from `@deepseek-ai/dsh-sandbox-mxc/provider`; ne"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"w profiles should load the package root through the bundle row."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The MXC runtime is the public `@omdsh-dev/mxc-sdk` `0.7.0` GitHub Release asset:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The package keeps the immutable v0.7.0 release URL in `dependencies` and lists `@omdsh-dev/mxc-sdk` "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"in `bundleDependencies`. `npm pack` therefore places the SDK, its native executors, and its denial-c"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"apture assets under `node_modules/@omdsh-dev/mxc-sdk` inside the published tarball; consumers do not"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" need to resolve the GitHub URL again."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Stent bundle behavior"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The row is disabled in ordinary profiles. `stent-dsh` reads the descriptors under `config.stent.patc"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"hes`, installs transformations before target modules load, and enables the row only for the Stent co"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"alls transformations before target modules load, and enables the row only for the Stent composition:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Handlers cover the existing public seams:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- foreground and background `@deepseek-ai/dsh-bash-sandbox` calls;
- foreground and background `@dee"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"pseek-ai/dsh-pwsh-sandbox` calls;
- process settlement hooks in the local bash and PowerShell execut"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"ors;
- `terminal-bash` backend creation immediately before the local terminal primitive spawns;
- `d"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"sh-subprocess-local.spawnTerminal` argument replacement;
- `@deepseek-ai/dsh-sandbox-local.confine` "},{"id":"p14s5","text":"terminal-only bypass, preventing the original terminal path from wrapping the MXC launch a second ti"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"minal-only bypass, preventing the original terminal path from wrapping the MXC launch a second time."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Each confined call prepares one MXC controller with exact argv, cwd, and the scrubbed-plus-explicit "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"environment. The controller settles from the versioned result envelope and is disposed exactly once."},{"id":"p15s3","text":" The host subprocess or terminal service still owns the process tree, timeout, signal, stdio, and qu"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"iescence operations. `danger-full-access` delegates to the original host call and never invokes MXC."},{"id":"p15s5","text":" Any MXC qualification or runner failure raises `SANDBOX_UNAVAILABLE`; it never falls back to an unc"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"cation or runner failure raises `SANDBOX_UNAVAILABLE`; it never falls back to an unconfined payload."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The workspace uses pnpm's `nodeLinker: hoisted` because pnpm cannot materialize `bundleDependencies`"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" from an isolated linker. Keep this setting for development installs. Use `npm pack`/`npm publish` f"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"or the final bundled artifact; the current pnpm packer normalizes nested bundled executable modes."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The real-executor suites self-skip when the platform-specific binary is unavailable. The release ass"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"et contains the native executor and denial-capture files; no GitHub Packages credentials or `.npmrc`"},{"id":"p19s3","text":" scope override is required."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Model Experience"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"This package adds no model-visible prompt, tool, or result text. Existing DSH bash and terminal cons"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"umers retain their rendering and error semantics; the sandbox seam owns the `SANDBOX_UNAVAILABLE` di"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ain their rendering and error semantics; the sandbox seam owns the `SANDBOX_UNAVAILABLE` diagnostic."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"#### KV Cache effect"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"No direct invalidation. The existing consumer owns any request-prefix changes."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Known Limitations and Deferred Work"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- MXC qualification requires a usable Bubblewrap/user-namespace host on Linux; macOS and Windows acc"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"eptance remains platform-dependent, and Windows Tier 3 requires explicit host DACL permission.
- The"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" SDK release is Public Preview. Its policy schema and native backends may change in a later SDK mino"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"r version; upgrading requires a deliberate dependency and policy-version review.
- The Stent descrip"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"tors are optional because DSH profiles choose bash or PowerShell by platform. A profile that enables"},{"id":"p25s6","text":" the bundle without loading a matching consumer does not receive a hook; the host must still compose"},{"id":"p25s7","text":" a supported sandbox consumer.
- `legacy/mxc-host-integration.patch` is historical evidence only. It"},{"id":"p25s8","text":" is not read, applied, or required by the Stent bundle."}],"truncated":false}
